<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CIGNA started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CIGNA started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read said analyst Michael Lewis initiated coverage of CIGNA Corp with a buy rating and SAFECO Corp as neutral.</p>
<p>-- estimated CIGNA earnings of $14.25 per share for 1997, and $15 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12- to 18-month price target of $180.  Shares fell 1/2 to 161-1/2.</p>
<p>-- estimated SAFECO earnings of $3.25 for 1997 and $3.55 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/2 to 41-1/2.</p>
</text>
